<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8440 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8440 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.8440 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.8000 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR		Feb 4		   Feb 3</p>
<p> High			     75.7700		 75.7600</p>
<p> Low				75.8500		 75.9480</p>
<p> Open			     75.7700		 75.9480</p>
<p> Close			    75.8440		 75.8000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    3.265		   5.305</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Feb 4		   Feb 3</p>
<p> High			     46.6500		 46.2300</p>
<p> Low				46.6500		 46.3501</p>
<p> Open			     46.6500		 46.3501</p>
<p> Close			    46.6500		 46.2300</p>
<p> Volume (DM million)	   0.005		   0.060</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
